    { "word": "the", "meaning": "Use the for a special thing that we both know about. There is only one, or we talked about it before.", "examples": ["the sun", "the door", "the bus to the library"] }
  ],
  "articleTip": "Listen to the first sound, not the first letter. In hour, the h is quiet, so we say an hour.",

